{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:86693d12015848d9","name":"Shadow Trooper","source":{"id":"source:reference-86693d12015848d9","title":"Shadow Trooper","revision":21740,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:23:24Z","sha256":"25865368aab1fd838ffa5d17470619dc95b1f76f2e62421044bce8344f1fd70f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21740","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Shadow%20Trooper&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-86693d12015848d9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Echoes of the Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Echoes_of_the_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:e6a2e80208e1e351"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["The Shadow Troopers' scarlet T-visors give the impression of demonic silhouettes, but their coordination and synchronization of movement reminds you that that these clones are highly trained killers."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["It's believed that when the curse \"Emperor's black bones\" was coined, it was at the sight of these ashen-armored soldiers. Imperial Shadow Troopers might be mistaken for regular ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Troopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Troopers"},", except that their stealth armor and red visors give them the appearance of demonic silhouettes. They are trained for reconnaissance and occasionally serve as guardians to vital facilities and personnel. Inquisitor ",{"tag":"a","children":["Valin Draco"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Valin_Draco","referenceId":"reference:225b744e6f6a9bf6"}," reasons that if they're good enough for the Emperor's secret ",{"tag":"a","children":["Utapau"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Utapau","referenceId":"reference:236cdadb0b901b45"}," storehouse, they're good enough for him.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Unlike that of other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stormtroopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stormtroopers"},", Shadow Trooper Armor retains its distinctive pre-Imperial appearance. There is talk of eventually streamlining Shadow Trooper Armor, but for now their scarlet T-visors remain a haunting reminder of Palpatine's bloody ascension to the rank of Emperor. Like all other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stormtroopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stormtroopers"},", Shadow Troopers cannot be bribed, blackmailed, or seduced. Any such attempt automatically fails.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Shadow Trooper Statistics (CL 3)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 4/",{"tag":"a","children":["Scout"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scout","referenceId":"reference:8a1db462be753774"}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 2 ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +9; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darkvision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darkvision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],